ial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"ml\":0.6,\"mr\":0.6,\"tm\":2}},\"catdefs\":[[\"normal\",\"Normal Set\"],[\"cmvju1drps7q\",\"Online Transfer\"],[\"cmvjucrqz530\",\"Army Normal Transfer\"],[\"cmvjudk875ln\",\"Army Online\"],[\"open\",\"Open Transfer\"],[\"behalf\",\"On Behalf\"],[\"cmvjthxjjz06\",\"Agreement\"],[\"cmvr1xlljm91\",\"Normal Set 2 Purchaser\"],[\"cmvr1xwcqd75\",\"Normal Set 2 Purchaser online\"]],\"szdef\":\"Legal\"},{\"id\":\"t0\",\"tid\":0,\"title\":\"(UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)  (By The Seller)\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Seller)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">        \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>I, \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No.\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Adult, Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm and declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I am bona fide member of DHA, Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Registration No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>dated _______ and I was Allotted / Transferred a plot of land bearing No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>  \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>in phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>measuring \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>situated in Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That by, virtue of the provisions of be law no. 17 of the Authority, I hereby return the original allocation/allotment letter no.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Dated ________for cancellation which I have sold to  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Registered Member of the Authority vide Registration No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>. Total sale price of the said plot has been received by me from purchaser and nothing outstands against the Purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That having relinquished the said plot to the Defence Housing Authority for further allotment to  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>and the possession of the plot be handed over to the said  \\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>conferring exclusive ownership right possession of the plot upon the above said Transferee / purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I affirm and declare that the name of  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>should be entered in the \\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\">records\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\"> of the DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter as the owner of the aforesaid property.\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I solemnly declare that I have no right, title or interest in the said property and  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>is the exclusive owner of the same since ______________.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I further affirm and declare that neither I have entered into an agreement for the sale of plot in question with any other person except the above said purchaser nor any suit is presently pending in any court of competent jurisdiction and no stay order is operative against the said plot. Furthermore, said plot is free from all encumbrances.in the event the above statement is found to be false, incorrect or untrue, the deponent shall pay the entire sale consideration with profit etc. to the purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I have deposited Advance Tax on DC Value rate on transfer/transfer allocation of above-mentioned plot/ file. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount/taxes related to me as seller imposed as a result of any variation in Dc value or any revision in rates by Govt of Punjab/ Pakistan and DHA Lahore Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"normal\",\"cmvju1drps7q\",\"cmvjucrqz530\",\"cmvjudk875ln\",\"open\"]},{\"id\":\"t1\",\"tid\":1,\"title\":\"(UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)  (By The Seller)     Page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That whatever is stated above is true to the best of my own knowledge and belief.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t\\u003c/span>  Reference No \\u003c/span>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Sector \\u003c/span>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Plot No: \\u003c/span>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Measuring\\u003c/span>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Phase \\u003c/span>\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">1 \\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cb style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\u003c/span>       \\u003cspan style=\\\"white-space:pre\\\">\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\u003c/span>       \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">\\u003cb style=\\\"\\\">(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">  \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">                                                                                                                                           \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Verification\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Verified on Oath at ____________, this _______________ day of ________________, that the contents of above undertaking/ affidavit are true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information and belief, and that nothing has been concealed therein.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">\\u003cb style=\\\"\\\">(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">\\u003cb>   \\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Certificate:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">I   Mr. _________________S/O _____________________ R/O_____________________________ C.N.I.C No._______________________ hereby  certify that the seller  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>  \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b> CNIC# \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>   is personally known to me.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">\\u003cb>Identifier:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Signature:\\u003cu> \\u003c/u>\\u003cu> \\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">_________________\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>                                                            \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"normal\",\"cmvju1drps7q\",\"cmvjucrqz530\",\"cmvjudk875ln\",\"open\"]},{\"id\":\"t2\",\"tid\":2,\"title\":\"UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT  (By The Purchaser)\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Purchaser)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">I,\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm, undertake &amp; declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I have purchased an Allocation Letter No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>, Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Application Form No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Which is being transferred in my name.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I the Purchaser Undertake That the Development charges of the above-mentioned plot will be paid by me to D.H.A Multan. Further affirm that I agree to pay the variation in Development Charges and plot size on demand. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>I will not make any addition / alteration in the building so purchased without prior approval from the Engineering Branch of the Authority. In case any change / Shifting of Electric Poles, Telephone Poles and manhole etc. are necessitated as per my requirement, it will be done at my risk and cost, if feasible.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>I shall not convert the property to different use(s) or purposes(s) other than that provided or permitted under the regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount / taxes related to Stamp Duty, CVT, Advanced Tax, Tax immovable Property, Capital Gain Tax / Withholding Tax if accrue as a result of any change in Dc value at later stage or otherwise.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>That I am also bound to make the payment of all taxes whatever are imposed by the Government of Punjab / Pakistan and DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>I am also bound for Payment of a/m Taxes which are to be paid by the seller or purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>I will ensure that Plot / House Tax / Other dues due to the Govt / DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter have been paid. I Shall not default or fail in payment of taxes and other duties of Central / Provincial Government.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">       \\u003c/span>I undertake to pay for any Variation in plot area. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">10.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I hereby undertake to abide by all rules, regulations / bye laws of the Defence Housing Authority.  \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">11.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I shall not damage the interest of the Authority and my act or omission shall not be detrimental to the aims and objectives as well as the reputation of the authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">12.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I shall obey the decision made or instruction issued by the Authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">13.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I shall not involve in violation of Authority’s Rules or Regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">14.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">I shall not involve in frivolous litigations with the Authority.\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"normal\",\"cmvju1drps7q\",\"cmvjucrqz530\",\"cmvjudk875ln\"]},{\"id\":\"t3\",\"tid\":3,\"title\":\"UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT  (By The Purchaser) Page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">15.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">I shall not misuse the dwelling or habitually act in an ungraceful manner or the manner which        \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">          may cause serious nuisance to my neighbors.\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">16.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">I further undertake I will submit transfer papers at DHA Reception within 30 days from the date \\\\ \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">          of transfer letter in my name, if I fail to do so I would be liable to pay the fine / penalty for late \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">          submission as per DHA procedure.\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">17.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">In case of possession of plot, I shall construct the building as per DHA Bye-laws/ Policy, failing \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">          which I will pay \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\">non-construction penalty \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\"> as applicable.\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">18.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">My specimen signatures are as under: -\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">  \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Signature: ___________________\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">               \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">____________________\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">            \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">____________________\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u00