\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">2.\\u003c/span>I further undertake that seller and purchaser are themselves responsible for the sale price of the said plot and will not claim DHA in case of any dispute if arises between seller and purchaser .\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">That whatever is stated above is true to the best of my knowledge and belief.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"dp\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">DEPONENT\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"\\\"Times New Roman\\\",Tinos,Times,serif\",\"lh\":1.5,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"behalf\"]},{\"id\":\"t5\",\"tid\":5,\"title\":\"AFFIDAVIT  (REPRESENTATIVE OF PURCHASER)\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">AFFIDAVIT\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">(REPRESENTATIVE OF PURCHASER)\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\"