tyle=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> Adult, Resident of \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">1.\\u003c/span>That I undertake the responsibility that purchaser will pay any of the new taxes or any variation in already existing taxes as introduced by the GOVT in the budget for financial year ___________.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">2.\\u003c/span>That I undertake the responsibility that purchaser will pay a/m taxes which are to be paid by the seller or purchaser.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"dp\\\">\\u003cfont face=\\\"Calibri, Carlito\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">DEPONENT\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"\\\"Times New Roman\\\",Tinos,Times,serif\",\"lh\":1.5,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"behalf\"]},{\"id\":\"t6\",\"tid\":6,\"title\":\"UNDERTAKING BY DEALERS\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">UNDERTAKING BY DEALERS\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"c\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"dealer_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"dealer_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"dealer_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> CNIC# \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"dealer_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> R/O \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"dealer_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> On behalf of I . \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> Having CNIC# \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> resident of \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> have purchased the plot of land bearing no \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Sector \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Plot no. \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> phase \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> measuring \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> Defence Housing Authority, Lahore-Multan chapter from \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> having C.N.I.C No \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> do hereby solemnly affirm and declare as under :\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">a.\\u003c/span>I Undertake that the original Purchaser of above mentioned plot is presently not in Pakistan /Multan due to his commitments. I am responsible for further any action and dues of above mention plot file to transfer, buyer signature and thumb .If I and my purchaser not followed above commitment DHA Multan has authority takes any legal action against Ref # \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> and me .Moreover full payment of said file has been transferred to actual seller and I am responsible for any discrepancies later on.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"dp\\\">DEPONENT\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"lb\\\">Verification\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>      Verified on Oath at Multan this________ ______day of___ _______________,that the contents of above affidavit are true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information and belief, and that nothing has been concealed therein\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"dp\\\">DEPONENT\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"behalf\"]},{\"id\":\"t7\",\"tid\":7,\"title\":\"Authority Letter\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 20pt;\\\">Authority Letter\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\" style=\\\"font-size:16pt\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>I, \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> Having CNIC# \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> resident of \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> Registration /Reference \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Plot No \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Sector \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Measuring \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>. I grant authority to \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> having C.N.I.C No \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> Resident of \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"behalf_res\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> to perform transfer procedure at DHA Multan Site Office .I am out of CITY and can’t come for transfer procedure.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:1.5in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cn\\\">________________            ____________________           __________________\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:.9in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cdiv style=\\\"margin-left:4.9in;font-weight:700\\\">__________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>Regards\\u003cbr>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"|u|n\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/div>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.5,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"behalf\"]},{\"id\":\"t8\",\"tid\":8,\"title\":\"AGREEMENT TO SELL A PLOT\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"cn\\\">\\u003cb>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">AGREEMENT TO SELL A PLOT\\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cn\\\">\\u003cb>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cn\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">For Plot No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, Sector \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, File Ref No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Category \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pl\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"|p\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pl\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"|p\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cn\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">DEFENCE HOUSING AUTHORITY (DHA), MULTAN.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">By this Deed of Agreement made on Date ___________\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">BETWEEN\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_t\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> CNIC No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> Resident of \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, hereinafter called “SELLER” First Party.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">AND\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"cb\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_t\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> CNIC No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> Resident of \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, hereinafter called “PURCHASER” Second Party.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">1.\\u003c/span>That the SELLER affirms that he is the owner of the Plot No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, Sector \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">, Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Category \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pl\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"|p\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pl\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"|p\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> situated in Defence Housing Authority (DHA), Multan vide File Ref No \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">2.\\u003c/span>That the SELLER further affirms and confirm that the said Plot is free from all encumbrance, charges, dues and litigation of all sorts and there is no loan against the said property.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">3.\\u003c/span>That the SELLER will make himself available and sign all documents which he is called upon to sign by DHA or Purchaser or in any other Office in future, in connection with transfer of above said Plot in favor of the Purchaser or any of his nominees.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:1.4in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cdiv class=\\\"sg\\\">\\u003cdiv>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">__________________________\\u003cbr>Signature &amp; Thumb Impression\\u003cbr>(SELLER)\\u003c/font>\\u003c/div>\\u003cdiv>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">__________________________\\u003cbr>Signature &amp; Thumb Impression\\u003cbr>(PURCHASER)\\u003c/font>\\u003c/div>\\u003c/div>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"cats\":[\"cmvjthxjjz06\"]},{\"id\":\"t9\",\"tid\":9,\"title\":\"AGREEMENT  Page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">4.\\u003c/span>All expenses regarding Transfer i.e. Transfer Fee, Membership Fee, CVT and Stamp Duty in respect of the said plot shall be borne by PURCHASER. Capital Gain Tax and Development Charges (to date) will be paid by SELLER.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">5.\\u003c/span>SELLER is selling and PURCHASER is purchasing the above said Plot at total price of ______________________________ vide Bankers Cheque No. ______________ dated ______________ of ______________________ in favor of “\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>” received from PURCHASER as Total Receipt which is hereby acknowledged by SELLER and there is no remaining amount of said Plot.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">6.\\u003c/span>That the seller will be responsible to clear all the dues of the said property i.e. Cost of Land, Additional Development Charges, land Charges, Non Utilization Charges, Debris Charges, Security Charges and Surcharges imposed by the Authority if any and other surcharges etc. of the said PLOT on or before due date of transfer.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">7.\\u003c/span>SELLER is bound to PURCHASER about original Allocation Letter and SELLER will not apply for Duplicate Allocation Letter in DHA Multan Office.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp class=\\\"li\\\">\\u003cspan class=\\\"nn\\\">8.\\u003c/span>That the terms “Seller” and “Purchaser” hereinbefore used shall include their respective heirs, legal representative, successors, assignees and nominees.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp>In WITNESS WHEREOF, the Parties have signed this Deed on the date mentioned above.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:1.5in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cdiv class=\\\"sg\\\">\\u003cdiv>__________________________\\u003cbr>Signature &amp; Thumb Impression\\u003cbr>(SELLER)\\u003c/div>\\u003cdiv>__________________________\\u003cbr>Signature &amp; Thumb Impression\\u003cbr>(PURCHASER)\\u003c/div>\\u003c/div>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:.3in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cdiv class=\\\"sg\\\">\\u003cdiv style=\\\"text-align:left;width:42%\\\">NAME: \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cbr>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cbr>CNIC No. \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/div>\\u003cdiv style=\\\"text-align:left;width:42%\\\">NAME: \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cbr>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cbr>CNIC No. \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/div>\\u003c/div>\\u003cp style=\\\"height:.9in\\\">\\u003c/p>\\u003cdiv class=\\\"sg\\\" style=\\\"justify-content:space-between;text-align:left\\\">\\u003cdiv style=\\\"width:44%\\\">WITNESS No.1\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>Signature:_____________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>NAME:_____________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri;\\\">S/O,W/O,D/O\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>_____________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>CNIC No.______________\\u003c/div>\\u003cdiv style=\\\"width:44%\\\">WITNESS No.2\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>Signature:_____________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>NAME:  _____________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>S/O,W/O,D/O  ___________________\\u003cbr>\\u003cbr>CNIC No. ________________\\u003c/div>\\u003c/div>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":1.25},\"cats\":[\"cmvjthxjjz06\"]},{\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"ml\":0.6,\"mr\":0.6,\"tm\":4.5},\"title\":\"(UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)  (By The Seller) 1\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Seller)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">I, \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No.\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Adult, Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm and declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I am bona fide member of DHA, Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Registration No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>dated _______ and I was Allotted / Transferred a plot of land bearing No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>  \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>in phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>measuring \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>situated in Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That by, virtue of the provisions of be law no. 17 of the Authority, I hereby return the original allocation/allotment letter no.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Dated ________for cancellation which I have sold to \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cb> 1\\u003c/b>  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>,\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>   \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b>  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Registered Member of the Authority vide Registration No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>. Total sale price of the said plot has been received by me from purchaser and nothing outstands against the Purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That having relinquished the said plot to the Defence Housing Authority for further allotment to \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>and the possession of the plot be handed over to the said \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>conferring exclusive ownership right possession of the plot upon the above said Transferee / purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I affirm and declare that the name of  \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>should be entered in the records of the DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter as the owner of the aforesaid property.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I solemnly declare that I have no right, title or interest in the said property and  \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>is the exclusive owner of the same since ______________.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I further affirm and declare that neither I have entered into an agreement for the sale of plot in question with any other person except the above said purchaser nor any suit is presently pending in any court of competent jurisdiction and no stay order is operative against the said plot. Furthermore, said plot is free from all encumbrances.in the event the above statement is found to be false, incorrect or untrue, the deponent shall pay the entire sale consideration with profit etc. to the purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I have deposited Advance Tax on DC Value rate on transfer/transfer allocation of above-mentioned plot/ file. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount/taxes related to me as seller imposed as a result of any variation in Dc value or any revision in rates by Govt of Punjab/ Pakistan and DHA Lahore Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\",\"cats\":[\"cmvr1xlljm91\",\"cmvr1xwcqd75\"],\"id\":\"pmvr1d4kvhlu3ww\",\"orig\":{\"title\":\"(UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)  (By The Seller) 1\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Seller)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">I, \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No.\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Adult, Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm and declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I am bona fide member of DHA, Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Registration No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>dated _______ and I was Allotted / Transferred a plot of land bearing No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>  \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003c/b>in phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>measuring \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>situated in Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That by, virtue of the provisions of be law no. 17 of the Authority, I hereby return the original allocation/allotment letter no.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Dated ________for cancellation which I have sold to \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cb> 1\\u003c/b>  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>,\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>   \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b>  \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Registered Member of the Authority vide Registration No.\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>. Total sale price of the said plot has been received by me from purchaser and nothing outstands against the Purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That having relinquished the said plot to the Defence Housing Authority for further allotment to \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>and the possession of the plot be handed over to the said \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>conferring exclusive ownership right possession of the plot upon the above said Transferee / purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I affirm and declare that the name of  \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>should be entered in the records of the DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter as the owner of the aforesaid property.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I solemnly declare that I have no right, title or interest in the said property and  \\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>is the exclusive owner of the same since ______________.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I further affirm and declare that neither I have entered into an agreement for the sale of plot in question with any other person except the above said purchaser nor any suit is presently pending in any court of competent jurisdiction and no stay order is operative against the said plot. Furthermore, said plot is free from all encumbrances.in the event the above statement is found to be false, incorrect or untrue, the deponent shall pay the entire sale consideration with profit etc. to the purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I have deposited Advance Tax on DC Value rate on transfer/transfer allocation of above-mentioned plot/ file. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount/taxes related to me as seller imposed as a result of any variation in Dc value or any revision in rates by Govt of Punjab/ Pakistan and DHA Lahore Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"ml\":0.6,\"mr\":0.6,\"tm\":4.5}}},{\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"title\":\"(By The Seller) Page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That whatever is stated above is true to the best of my own knowledge and belief.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">Reference No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Plot No: \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">       \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Verification\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Verified on Oath at ____________, this _______________ day of ________________, that the contents of above undertaking/ affidavit are true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information and belief, and that nothing has been concealed therein.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>               \\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Certificate:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">I   Mr. _________________S/O _____________________ R/O_____________________________ C.N.I.C No._______________________ hereby  certify that the seller \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b> CNIC# \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>   is personally known to me.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\\">\\u003cb>Identifier:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Signature:\\u003cu> \\u003c/u>\\u003cu>                                                                         \\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\",\"cats\":[\"cmvr1xlljm91\",\"cmvr1xwcqd75\"],\"id\":\"pmvr1h2dtetywl4\",\"orig\":{\"title\":\"(By The Seller) Page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That whatever is stated above is true to the best of my own knowledge and belief.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">Reference No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Plot No: \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.25in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">       \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Verification\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Verified on Oath at ____________, this _______________ day of ________________, that the contents of above undertaking/ affidavit are true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information and belief, and that nothing has been concealed therein.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>(DEPONENT)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>               \\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5.5in;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>Certificate:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">I   Mr. _________________S/O _____________________ R/O_____________________________ C.N.I.C No._______________________ hereby  certify that the seller \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b> CNIC# \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"seller_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>   is personally known to me.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\\">\\u003cb>Identifier:\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">Signature:\\u003cu> \\u003c/u>\\u003cu>                                                                         \\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5}}},{\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5},\"title\":\"By The Purchaser 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Purchaser)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">We ,\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb> Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No\\u003cb>.\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No\\u003cb>.\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm, undertake &amp; declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I have purchased an Allocation Letter No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>, Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Application Form No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Which is being transferred in my name.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I the Purchaser Undertake That the Development charges of the above-mentioned plot will be paid by me to D.H.A Multan. Further affirm that I agree to pay the variation in Development Charges and plot size on demand. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I will not make any addition / alteration in the building so purchased without prior approval from the Engineering Branch of the Authority. In case any change / Shifting of Electric Poles, Telephone Poles and manhole etc. are necessitated as per my requirement, it will be done at my risk and cost, if feasible.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I shall not convert the property to different use(s) or purposes(s) other than that provided or permitted under the regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">    \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount / taxes related to Stamp Duty, CVT, Advanced Tax, Tax immovable Property, Capital Gain Tax / Withholding Tax if accrue as a result of any change in Dc value at later stage or otherwise.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I am also bound to make the payment of all taxes whatever are imposed by the Government of Punjab / Pakistan and DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I am also bound for Payment of a/m Taxes which are to be paid by the seller or purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I will ensure that Plot / House Tax / Other dues due to the Govt / DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter have been paid. I Shall not default or fail in payment of taxes and other duties of Central / Provincial Government.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I undertake to pay for any Variation in plot area.             \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">10.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I hereby undertake to abide by all rules, regulations / bye laws of the Defence Housing Authority.  \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">11.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall not damage the interest of the Authority and my act or omission shall not be detrimental to the aims and objectives as well as the reputation of the authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">12.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall obey the decision made or instruction issued by the Authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">13.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall not involve in violation of Authority’s Rules or Regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\">14. \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\\\">I shall not involve in frivolous litigations with the Authority.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\",\"cats\":[\"cmvr1xlljm91\",\"cmvr1xwcqd75\"],\"id\":\"pmvr1n3wc0w53zs\",\"orig\":{\"title\":\"By The Purchaser 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>UNDERTAKING/AFFIDAVIT\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 16pt;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>(By The Purchaser)\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">We ,\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb> Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No\\u003cb>.\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> , \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">\\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b>\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>having C.N.I.C No\\u003cb>.\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Resident of \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_res\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Possession of my full faculties and senses and of my free will and without any coercion or duress, do hereby solemnly affirm, undertake &amp; declare as under:- \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">1.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I have purchased an Allocation Letter No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>, Plot No. \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span> \\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>in Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Defence Housing Authority Lahore – Multan Chapter vide Application Form No \\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Which is being transferred in my name.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">2.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I the Purchaser Undertake That the Development charges of the above-mentioned plot will be paid by me to D.H.A Multan. Further affirm that I agree to pay the variation in Development Charges and plot size on demand. \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">3.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I will not make any addition / alteration in the building so purchased without prior approval from the Engineering Branch of the Authority. In case any change / Shifting of Electric Poles, Telephone Poles and manhole etc. are necessitated as per my requirement, it will be done at my risk and cost, if feasible.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">4.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">   \\u003c/span>I shall not convert the property to different use(s) or purposes(s) other than that provided or permitted under the regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">5.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">    \\u003c/span>That I do hereby undertake to pay any additional amount / taxes related to Stamp Duty, CVT, Advanced Tax, Tax immovable Property, Capital Gain Tax / Withholding Tax if accrue as a result of any change in Dc value at later stage or otherwise.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">6.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>That I am also bound to make the payment of all taxes whatever are imposed by the Government of Punjab / Pakistan and DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">7.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I am also bound for Payment of a/m Taxes which are to be paid by the seller or purchaser.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">8.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I will ensure that Plot / House Tax / Other dues due to the Govt / DHA Lahore – Multan Chapter have been paid. I Shall not default or fail in payment of taxes and other duties of Central / Provincial Government.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">9.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I undertake to pay for any Variation in plot area.             \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">10.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I hereby undertake to abide by all rules, regulations / bye laws of the Defence Housing Authority.  \\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">11.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall not damage the interest of the Authority and my act or omission shall not be detrimental to the aims and objectives as well as the reputation of the authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">12.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall obey the decision made or instruction issued by the Authority.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">13.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 7pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">  \\u003c/span>I shall not involve in violation of Authority’s Rules or Regulations.\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in;\\\">\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\">14. \\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\\\">I shall not involve in frivolous litigations with the Authority.\\u003c/span>\\u003cspan style=\\\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt;\\\"> \\u003c/span>\\u003c/p>\",\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":4.5}}},{\"meta\":{\"f\":\"Calibri,Carlito,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif\",\"lh\":1.22,\"tm\":3.5},\"title\":\"Purchaser 2 page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">15.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I shall not misuse the dwelling or habitually act in an ungraceful manner or the manner which may cause    \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            serious nuisance to my neighbors.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">16.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I further undertake I will submit transfer papers at DHA Reception within 30 days from the date of transfer \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            letter in my name, if I fail to do so I would be liable to pay the fine / penalty for late submission as per DHA \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            procedure.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">17.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">     \\u003c/span>In case of possession of plot, I shall construct the building as per DHA Bye-laws/ Policy, failing which I will pay \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            non constructions penalty as applicable.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">18.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>My specimen signatures are as under: -  \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp data-ls=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.15;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Signature: ___________________               ____________________             ____________________\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Name:    \\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b>   \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>CNIC No:\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Plot No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Phase \\u003cb>1 \\u003c/b>Reference No: \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Signature: ___________________               ____________________             ____________________\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Name:    \\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>2\\u003c/b> \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_rel\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_relname\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb>\\u003c/b>CNIC No:\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch2_cnic\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Plot No. \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"plot_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Sector\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"sector\\\" data-m=\\\"|u\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb>  \\u003c/b>Phase 1\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Reference No: \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"ref_no\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>Measuring\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"measuring\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\"> \\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"category\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003cb>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Date       ___________________\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0.5in;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb>DEPONENT 1\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>                                                                                                   \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>DEPONENT 2\\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5in; text-indent: 0.5in;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 5in; text-indent: 0.5in;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cu>\\u003cb>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Verification\\u003c/font>\\u003c/b>\\u003c/u>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Verified on Oath at ______________, this____________ day of __________, that the contents of above undertaking / affidavit are true and correct to the best of my knowledge, information and belief, and that nothing has been concealed therein. \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left; margin-left: 0.5in; text-indent: 0.5in;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb>DEPONENT 1\\u003c/b>\\u003cb>                                   \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>                                \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>                                \\u003c/b>\\u003cb>DEPONENT 2\\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\",\"cats\":[\"cmvr1xlljm91\",\"cmvr1xwcqd75\"],\"id\":\"pmvr1wcau7n4c5m\",\"orig\":{\"title\":\"Purchaser 2 page 2\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">15.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I shall not misuse the dwelling or habitually act in an ungraceful manner or the manner which may cause    \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            serious nuisance to my neighbors.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">16.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>I further undertake I will submit transfer papers at DHA Reception within 30 days from the date of transfer \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            letter in my name, if I fail to do so I would be liable to pay the fine / penalty for late submission as per DHA \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            procedure.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">17.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">     \\u003c/span>In case of possession of plot, I shall construct the building as per DHA Bye-laws/ Policy, failing which I will pay \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">            non constructions penalty as applicable.\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: 1.15;\\\" data-ls=\\\"1\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">18.\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">      \\u003c/span>My specimen signatures are as under: -  \\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp data-ls=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.15;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cbr>\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Signature: ___________________               ____________________             ____________________\\u003c/font>\\u003c/p>\\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">Name:    \\u003cb>Purchaser\\u003c/b> \\u003cb>1\\u003c/b>   \\u003c/font>\\u003cb>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:none\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-k=\\\"purch_name\\\" data-m=\\\"\\\">\\u003c/span>\\u003c/b>\\u003cfont style=\\\"font-size: 11pt;\\\">\\u003cb> \\u003c/b>\\u003c/font>\\u003cspan class=\\\"ph pf\\\" sty